  "kind": "other",
  "n": "Y90 plus sorafenib vs Y90 alone. Of 23 randomized, 20 received treatment (10 per arm).",
  "bottom_line": "8/10 vs 9/10 received a graft. Time to transplant did not differ significantly (P=0.35). Biliary complications within 30 days occurred in 4/8 vs 0/9 recipients (P=0.029).",
  "limitations": [
    "All 10 sorafenib patients required a permanent dose reduction. The pilot was too small to establish an effect on transplant receipt or survival."
  ],
  "critique": [
