  "kind": "other",
  "n": "38 retrospective studies of bridging LRT vs no bridging in HCC, focused on patients within Milan criteria (39,819 patients overall).",
  "bottom_line": "Post-transplant recurrence-free survival HR 0.91 (95% CI 0.77–1.08) and overall survival HR 1.09 (95% CI 0.95–1.24).",
  "limitations": [
    "Five studies reported waitlist dropout (287 bridged, 166 unbridged) and found no significant difference. Selection and differences in waiting time limit inference."
  ],
  "critique": [
